{
  "type": "mod",
  "id": 2304,
  "hub_id": 3019,
  "guid": "net.drexira.neonsigns",
  "name": "Dragon Den - Neon Signs",
  "slug": "dragon-den-neon-signs",
  "teaser": "15 custom neon signs to brighten up Tarkov. They glow, they stand out, and you can use them just like posters.",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/3019.png",
  "downloads": 6987,
  "favourites_count": 11,
  "description": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Features and Usage</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><strong>Features</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>15 new neon sign items</li>\n<li>Glows properly in dark spots</li>\n<li>Spawns in raid where posters normally spawn</li>\n<li>Can be placed in hideout poster slots</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Usage</strong></p>\n<p>They work like posters… you’ll find them in raid at poster spawn points, and you can stick them in hideout poster slots.</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Image Galore</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Drexira/DragonDen-NeonSigns/refs/heads/SPT-3.11/Showcase%20Pictures/Neon%20Sign%20-%20Baby%20Appa%20Ingame.png\" alt=\"Neon Sign - Baby Appa Ingame\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Drexira/DragonDen-NeonSigns/refs/heads/SPT-3.11/Showcase%20Pictures/Neon%20Sign%20-%20Baby%20Appa.png\" alt=\"Neon Sign - Baby Appa\" /> <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Drexira/DragonDen-NeonSigns/refs/heads/SPT-3.11/Showcase%20Pictures/Neon%20Sign%20-%20Blushy%20Bear.png\" alt=\"Neon Sign - Blushy Bear\" /> <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Drexira/DragonDen-NeonSigns/refs/heads/SPT-3.11/Showcase%20Pictures/Neon%20Sign%20-%20Cute%20Cow.png\" alt=\"Neon Sign - Cute Cow\" /> <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Drexira/DragonDen-NeonSigns/refs/heads/SPT-3.11/Showcase%20Pictures/Neon%20Sign%20-%20DVA.png\" alt=\"Neon Sign - DVA\" /> <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Drexira/DragonDen-NeonSigns/refs/heads/SPT-3.11/Showcase%20Pictures/Neon%20Sign%20-%20Finger%20Heart.png\" alt=\"Neon Sign - Finger Heart\" /> <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Drexira/DragonDen-NeonSigns/refs/heads/SPT-3.11/Showcase%20Pictures/Neon%20Sign%20-%20Hand%20Flame.png\" alt=\"Neon Sign - Hand Flame\" /> <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Drexira/DragonDen-NeonSigns/refs/heads/SPT-3.11/Showcase%20Pictures/Neon%20Sign%20-%20Kawaii.png\" alt=\"Neon Sign - Kawaii\" /> <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Drexira/DragonDen-NeonSigns/refs/heads/SPT-3.11/Showcase%20Pictures/Neon%20Sign%20-%20Kuromi.png\" alt=\"Neon Sign - Kuromi\" /> <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Drexira/DragonDen-NeonSigns/refs/heads/SPT-3.11/Showcase%20Pictures/Neon%20Sign%20-%20Lip%20Bite.png\" alt=\"Neon Sign - Lip Bite\" /> <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Drexira/DragonDen-NeonSigns/refs/heads/SPT-3.11/Showcase%20Pictures/Neon%20Sign%20-%20Love%20Note.png\" alt=\"Neon Sign - Love Note\" /> <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Drexira/DragonDen-NeonSigns/refs/heads/SPT-3.11/Showcase%20Pictures/Neon%20Sign%20-%20Onii.png\" alt=\"Neon Sign - Onii\" /> <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Drexira/DragonDen-NeonSigns/refs/heads/SPT-3.11/Showcase%20Pictures/Neon%20Sign%20-%20Rose%20Heart.png\" alt=\"Neon Sign - Rose Heart\" /> <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Drexira/DragonDen-NeonSigns/refs/heads/SPT-3.11/Showcase%20Pictures/Neon%20Sign%20-%20Sailor%20Moon%20Cat.png\" alt=\"Neon Sign - Sailor Moon Cat\" /> <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Drexira/DragonDen-NeonSigns/refs/heads/SPT-3.11/Showcase%20Pictures/Neon%20Sign%20-%20Sailor%20Moon%20Girl.png\" alt=\"Neon Sign - Sailor Moon Girl\" /> <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Drexira/DragonDen-NeonSigns/refs/heads/SPT-3.11/Showcase%20Pictures/Neon%20Sign%20-%20Skulls.png\" alt=\"Neon Sign - Skulls\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Installation</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Unpack the zip and drop the user folder into your SPTarkov root.</p>\n<p>(Use 7Zip <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.7-zip.org/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Here</a>)</p>\n<p>Install demo video (credit to Drakia):</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vKRw58b.gif\" alt=\"Demonstration\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-4\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Known Issues</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>None that I know of.</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-5\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Credits</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><strong>Welcome to Tarkov</strong> (WTT) for: Mod framework and helping me</p>\n<p><strong>Drakia</strong> for: The install video</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-6\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">What is Dragon Den</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><strong>Dragon Den</strong> is my twist on Tarkov. It’s where cuteness, edgyness, and weirdness all collide, while still keeping things believable.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Traders with their own quirks and attitude</li>\n<li>Custom items and quests that feel fresh</li>\n<li>Backpacks, armor, facewear and headwear with personality</li>\n<li>Odd creations that shouldn’t exist… but somehow fit right in</li>\n</ul>\n<p>No weapons, just everything else that makes Tarkov less boring.</p>\n<p>Want to reach me? Look for #drexiras-dragon-den in <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://discord.gg/WelcomeToTarkov\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Welcome To Tarkov’s Discord</a></p></div></div></div>\n",
